        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then Jacob was greatly afraid and was distressed. He divided the people who were with him, along with the flocks, the herds, and the camels, into two companies.",
      "ko": "야곱이 심히 두렵고 답답하여 자기와 함께한 종자와 양과 소와 약대를 두 떼로 나누고",
      "source_text_hash": "53768d34a306a247d946e39f850d1946b5949fa180fbc139921c71664e9633be",
      "translation_text_hash": "12f2d2d6dc560c44013c45d4a0e521054ec0d90ab783d9a2281863a6bb3f2b92",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "야곱이 심히 두렵고 답답하여 자기와 함께한 종자와 양과 소와 약대를 두 떼로 나누고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "12f2d2d6dc560c44013c45d4a0e521054ec0d90ab783d9a2281863a6bb3f2b92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GEN:32:8",
      "sequence": 937,
      "chapter_label": "GEN 32",
      "verse_label": "8",
      "locator": {
