      "en": "He stayed there that night, and took from that which he had with him a present for Esau, his brother:",
      "ko": "야곱이 거기서 경야하고 그 소유 중에서 형 에서를 위하여 예물을 택하니",
      "source_text_hash": "bfa723e8381dfaedbeb4494b79e8cf1a16eccae858dd71a31c8138dbdf7c6344",
      "translation_text_hash": "757532ebbb2a8f48852366c02b7620f24f62ceb73779daea6243a36db72826b9",
